<figure class="bb-verification-loop" aria-label="Blackbox behavioral harness loop from intent to runtime verdict">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 980 440" role="img" aria-labelledby="bb-vl-title bb-vl-desc">
    <title id="bb-vl-title">The Blackbox behavioral harness loop</title>
    <desc id="bb-vl-desc">Natural-language intent becomes reviewed requirements, reviewed Gherkin, an approved system-test flow, runtime evidence, effect contracts, and layered verdicts. Implementation repair loops automatically while accepted behavior changes stop for human review.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="bb-vl-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#94a3b8"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <rect x="8" y="8" width="964" height="424" rx="18" fill="#111827" stroke="#374151"></rect>
    <text x="36" y="45" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="20" font-weight="800">Build the harness before trusting behavior</text>
    <text x="36" y="72" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="13">Guides steer the agent. Sensors observe the system. Humans approve accepted behavior.</text>

    <rect x="36" y="114" width="160" height="84" rx="12" fill="#1f2937" stroke="#fbbf24"></rect>
    <text x="116" y="143" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fef3c7" font-size="14" font-weight="800">Product intent</text>
    <text x="116" y="166" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fde68a" font-size="12">human language</text>
    <text x="116" y="183" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fcd34d" font-size="11">ticket, Kiro, OpenSpec, Spec Kit</text>

    <line x1="208" y1="156" x2="250" y2="156" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#bb-vl-arrow)"></line>

    <rect x="262" y="114" width="160" height="84" rx="12" fill="#172554" stroke="#60a5fa"></rect>
    <text x="342" y="143" text-anchor="middle" fill="#eff6ff" font-size="14" font-weight="800">Skill proposals</text>
    <text x="342" y="166" text-anchor="middle" fill="#bfdbfe" font-size="12">EARS, Gherkin, suite</text>
    <text x="342" y="183" text-anchor="middle" fill="#93c5fd" font-size="11">inferential harness</text>

    <line x1="434" y1="156" x2="476" y2="156" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#bb-vl-arrow)"></line>

    <rect x="488" y="114" width="160" height="84" rx="12" fill="#78350f" stroke="#fbbf24"></rect>
    <text x="568" y="143" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fef3c7" font-size="14" font-weight="800">Human gates</text>
    <text x="568" y="166" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fde68a" font-size="12">review and accept</text>
    <text x="568" y="183" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fcd34d" font-size="11">behavior changes here</text>

    <line x1="660" y1="156" x2="702" y2="156" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#bb-vl-arrow)"></line>

    <rect x="714" y="104" width="220" height="104" rx="13" fill="#14532d" stroke="#86efac"></rect>
    <text x="824" y="135" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0fdf4" font-size="14" font-weight="800">Computational run</text>
    <text x="824" y="158" text-anchor="middle" fill="#bbf7d0" font-size="12">validate, execute, capture</text>
    <text x="824" y="177" text-anchor="middle" fill="#86efac" font-size="11">system tests + effects + reports</text>
    <text x="824" y="194" text-anchor="middle" fill="#86efac" font-size="11">computational harness</text>

    <line x1="824" y1="220" x2="824" y2="260" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#bb-vl-arrow)"></line>

    <rect x="664" y="272" width="270" height="90" rx="13" fill="#164e63" stroke="#67e8f9"></rect>
    <text x="799" y="303" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ecfeff" font-size="14" font-weight="800">Layered verdict</text>
    <text x="799" y="326" text-anchor="middle" fill="#cffafe" font-size="12">requirements, features, effects, decisions</text>
    <text x="799" y="345" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a5f3fc" font-size="11">repair signal, not silent approval</text>

    <path d="M652 318 C558 318 548 236 568 210" fill="none" stroke="#67e8f9" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 6" marker-end="url(#bb-vl-arrow)"></path>
    <text x="528" y="300" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a5f3fc" font-size="12" font-weight="700">repair implementation</text>

    <path d="M652 346 C390 402 116 372 116 212" fill="none" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 6" marker-end="url(#bb-vl-arrow)"></path>
    <text x="363" y="387" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fde68a" font-size="12" font-weight="700">new or ambiguous behavior returns to review</text>

    <rect x="36" y="238" width="326" height="88" rx="12" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569"></rect>
    <text x="55" y="265" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="12" font-weight="800">Repository memory</text>
    <text x="55" y="288" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="12">requirements + features + flow tags + effects</text>
    <text x="55" y="307" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="11">readable by future humans, agents, and CI</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Implementation repair can loop quickly. Changes to accepted behavior follow the longer path through human review.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bb-verification-loop {
    margin: 28px 0;
    padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .bb-verification-loop svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 760px;
    height: auto;
  }

  .bb-verification-loop figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
